# Plugin: Writing Skills Adapter

Purpose:
  Adapt Superpowers writing-skills skill for SDDRA skill creation.

Source:
  D:\Tasks\ai_code\vkard.az\tmp\external-repo-audit\repo-01\skills\writing-skills\SKILL.md

Original:
  Methodology for creating new skills
  Testing methodology for skills

Adapted for SDDRA:
  SDDRA skill format:
    .sdd/skills/{category}/{technology}/{L1-L5}.sdd

  Skill structure:
    Purpose:
      <what the skill teaches>
    Owns: ./
    ReadOrder:
      1 @INDEX.sdd
      2 @../INDEX.sdd
      3 @{skill}.sdd
    Rules:
      [S1] <rule 1>
      [S2] <rule 2>
    State: +

  Creation guidelines:
    - One skill per file
    - Maximum 200 lines
    - Short IDs where possible
    - Index references, not full paths
    - Rules as numbered list

  Testing:
    - Skill must be resolvable from INDEX
    - Skill must not create circular references
    - Skill must fit within token budget

Usage:
  Referenced by:
    .sdd/PROJECT.sdd (skills section)
    .sdd/skills/INDEX.sdd

  Triggers:
    - New technology added to stack
    - New pattern discovered
    - Skill gap identified

State: Adapted
